Scandinavian mid-century modern. [[Hans Wegner]], Finn Juhl.

Chairs tied to the craft of high-end woodworking and joinery. Paper cord and cordage, or simple fabric, or mainly the wood itself.

Seed from [[What else is a chair for? (voice memo)]]. Compare the knots in [[Why is it squat?]], and the [[Wishbone Chair]].
